	<key>readme</key>
	<string>VLX Fast Access - Alfred Workflow

Search, view, and interact with Visualogyx inspections directly from Alfred.

Setup:
1. Set your VLX API key in the workflow configuration (API_KEY variable)
2. Optionally change the keyword (default: vlx)

Usage:
- Type 'vlx' followed by your search query to find inspections
- Select an inspection to view its actions menu
- Choose from: Title, Description, Status, Location, Report, Settings, Back, Website

API Reference: https://developer.vlx.ai/reference/getting-started-with-your-api</string>
